      "id": "kb-1",
      "title": "How to open a Savings Account",
      "content": "To open a Savings Account, sign up as a customer, verify your email and phone, submit valid KYC (Aadhaar or PAN Card), and wait for approval from our branch manager. Once approved, you can fund your account immediately.",
